  "description": "This rake is designed to last throughout the seasons. The all-steel construction coupled with a black rust-resistant coated finish ensures that rusting is not a problem. Enjoy continued use and dependability, no matter the weather.\nFitment\n21 Pine Straw Rake with 2\" Receiver for Lawn Tractors ATVs / UTVs Implement Lift\nFeatures\nSPRING STEEL TINES:\nGet the job done with ease using our landscape rake featuring 21 replaceable spring steel tines. Standing at an impressive 13 inches tall, these tines are tough enough to tackle a range of tasks including clearing brush, prepping soil, raking horse arenas, dethatching lawns, and more.\n60\" WORKING WIDTH:\nSave time and effort with our 60\" wide rake that covers more ground in less time. Whether you're a professional landscaper or a weekend warrior, this rake is designed to make your job more efficient, allowing you to complete tasks quickly and easily.\nRUST RESISTANT COATING:\nDon't let rust slow you down. Our rake is constructed from high-quality steel and features a black rust-resistant coated finish. This ensures that your rake will withstand the test of time and remain in excellent condition, even after extended use throughout the seasons.\nEXTENSIVE COMPATIBILITY:\nDesigned to fit most ATVs/UTVs with 2-inch receivers, our rake offers extensive compatibility, making it easy for you to attach and use with your preferred vehicle. It is also compatible with the LEDKINGDOMUS ATV/UTV Manual Implement Lift, adding even more versatility to your landscaping arsenal.\nThe interface of the receiver is 2\" as the inner diameter size, not the outer diameter. It does not include the dimensions of the receiver edge. Please be aware of this.",
